description:
A draggable, swipeable slider built on Embla Carousel, with autoplay, fade, auto-height, thumbnails and scroll effects.

  Carousel(loop: true) do
    CarouselContent do
      slides.each { |slide| CarouselSlide { img(src: slide.url, alt: slide.title) } }
    end
    CarouselPrev { |prev| Button(**prev, variant: :outline, icon: true, class: "rounded-full") { chevron_left } }
    CarouselNext { |nxt| Button(**nxt, variant: :outline, icon: true, class: "rounded-full") { chevron_right } }
    CarouselPagination(class: "absolute inset-x-0 top-full mt-5 justify-center")
  end

Flat options mirror Embla's (`loop:`, `align:`, `slides_to_scroll:`, `drag_free:` …); `options:` is a raw Embla options hash merged last. The plugins are switched on with `autoplay:`, `auto_scroll:`, `fade:`, `auto_height:` and `wheel_gestures:` (true or a hash).

